1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Once, a farmer found a baby eagle that had fallen from its nest.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Not knowing what else to do, he brought it home and placed it in his chicken coop.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,000
The eagle grew up surrounded by chickens, clucking and pecking the ground.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
It believed it was just like them.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Years passed.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
One day, a naturalist visited the farm.

7
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
He saw the eagle scratching in the dirt like a chicken and was stunned.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Why isn't eagle living like a chicken?

9
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,000
He asked.

10
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
The farmer shrugged.

11
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
It was raised as one.

12
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,000
It doesn't know any better.

13
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,000
The naturalist was determined to change that.

14
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
He picked up the eagle and climbed a nearby hill.

15
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Holding the eagle up toward the sky, he said,

16
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:44,000
You are an eagle.

17
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,000
You are made to soar.

18
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Stretch your wings and fly.

19
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,000
But the eagle looked down at the chickens below and jumped back to the ground.

20
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,000
The next day, the naturalist returned.

21
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,000
He climbed a higher mountain and held the eagle up again.

22
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:02,000
This time, the wind caught the eagle's wings.

23
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,000
The birds stretched them, uncertain.

24
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Then suddenly, it leapt.

25
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:09,000
For the first time, the eagle soared.

26
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,000
High, free and powerful, finally realizing what it was born to be.

